{"url":"https:\/\/x.com\/PerpetualCow\/status\/2123760480061718801","author_name":"PerpetualCow.hl","author_url":"https:\/\/x.com\/PerpetualCow","html":"\u003Cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"\u003E\u003Cp lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003EPost-mortem of the $13m XMR hack:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EIt&#39;s WORSE than I thought.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003ETurns out that the entire hosting provider of \u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/skXiWey4Fb\"\u003Ehttps:\/\/t.co\/skXiWey4Fb\u003C\/a\u003E got hacked with everyone&#39;s data + internal server files today.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EThe XMR1 deployer key was held on an OLD server on there that I DELETED, but…\u003C\/p\u003E&mdash; PerpetualCow.hl (@PerpetualCow) \u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/PerpetualCow\/status\/2123760480061718801?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003ENovember 20, 2026\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/blockquote\u003E\n\u003Cscript async src=\"https:\/\/platform.x.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"\u003E\u003C\/script\u003E\n\n","width":550,"height":null,"type":"rich","cache_age":"3153600000","provider_name":"X","provider_url":"https:\/\/x.com","version":"1.0"}